on rightclick on a dolphin:
  make the player ride event-entity

on rightclick on entity:
  if player is sneaking:
    make event-entity ride player

on sneak toggle:
  player is sneaking
  entity is riding player
  eject any passengers from player

on rightclick on a player:
  # This shit makes me want to fucking kill myself
  summon a pig at event-entity
  set ai of the last spawned entity to false
  make the last spawned entity invisible
  make the last spawned entity ride event-entity
  make the player ride the last spawned entity
  set metadata value "steed" of the last spawned entity to 1
  set metadata value "rider" of the last spawned entity to "%name of player%"

every 10 ticks:
  loop all pigs:
    if metadata value "steed" of loop-entity is 1:
      if player(metadata value "rider" of loop-entity) is not riding a pig:
        kill loop-entity
      if metadata value "rider" of loop-entity is not set:
        kill loop-entity

on redstone change:
  if event-block is muddy mangrove roots:
    if redstone power of event-block is greater than 0:
      create an explosion of force 10 at event-block
